 "_doc": "#1511 THE category of every shared lib the Store's Libs pages list (Shared libs, Machine-learning libs): the same macro-group shape as app_categories / lib_apks.categories (id, label, members), declared ONCE. cloud-android-lib-consumers.py reads it into lib-consumers.json (category, class, ships, consumers per lib) and its check fails when a shared lib is in no category, in two, or a member is not a lib, so a new lib must be categorized here in the same commit. Order of this list is the order of the page's groups; engines (installable APKs) are categorized by lib_apks.categories in lib-apks/build.json instead.",
